mk> What is the method to keep nymphs from stealing things from me, and 
mk> lepracauns also?  I just started playing the game, and I'm having a lot
mk> of trouble staying alive unless i'm in exploratory mode.  Any hints to help
mk> me out?

Well with nymphs you can always cancel them (use a spell or wand),
although I've always taken the more brutal approach, pursuit!  I like
throwing weapons at them then wailing on them when they get close,
'cause when they die they often leave a potion of object detection.
(Killing a nymph and eating it identifies this potion for me and is
usually where I get the teleport intrinsic from).

With leprechauns, I believe that the same tricks work, but with this
added piece of advice, when you see a leprechaun in a room throw your
money out the door, it seems (to me) that the little guy only
teleports away from you once he has managed to rip off some gold from
you, if you don't have any gold and there's none in the room, he can't
take it and fly, so he stays there and you get to partake of his
corpse and maybe find yourself feeling jumpy.
